$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Old Terra" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> After crashing on the planet Old Terra, The <vServer::teamName0> and The <vServer::teamName1> battle each other on the ancient world.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture.  The battle takes place in the ruins of an archaic place of warship called Stonehenge.  Each team is equipped with a vehicle replicator as well.  The first team with eight captures shall be the victor!";